{"key":"efb47452a604c2c5","source_file":"Potts Do - Dy.json","source_id":23977,"source_url":"concordance-draw-back-ppl-retrahere","term":"Draw back","headwords":["Draw back","Drawing back"],"latin":["Retrahere","Retractio"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Draw back"],"latin":["Retrahere"]},{"english":["Drawing back"],"latin":["Retractio"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","AE","CL","DLW"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"5479","subsection":null},"text":"Something of drawing back. Signified. The Lord moderates the influx of good according to the state of the man or Angel; it is this moderation which is meant by drawing back. AC 5647.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"5647","subsection":"end"},"text":"When the natural man thinks thus, he draws himself back... AC 5650:2.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"5828","subsection":"3"},"text":"The influx of good draws itself back...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DLW","section":"254","subsection":"end"},"text":"With a retracted nose...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"224","subsection":"end"},"text":"They look at their wives with a retracted sight.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"241","subsection":null},"text":"He can only speak to her with a voice of retracted tone.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AE","section":"706","subsection":"16"},"text":"The drawing back of the shadow (on the dial).","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"draw-back","url":"/meta/potts/draw-back/"}